## Set up Snowflake

Create a free trial account.
Run 01_setup.sql:
CREATE WAREHOUSE GEOPULSE_WH WAREHOUSE_SIZE='XSMALL' AUTO_SUSPEND=60 AUTO_RESUME=TRUE;
CREATE DATABASE GEOPULSE_DB;
CREATE SCHEMA GEOPULSE_DB.RAW;

## Create tables with GEOGRAPHY type (02_create_tables.sql)
sql:
CREATE OR REPLACE TABLE RAW.PINGS_STAGING (
  DEVICE_ID STRING,
  LATITUDE FLOAT,
  LONGITUDE FLOAT,
  PING_TS TIMESTAMP_NTZ
);

CREATE OR REPLACE TABLE RAW.DEVICE_PINGS (
  DEVICE_ID STRING,
  PING_TS TIMESTAMP_NTZ,
  LOCATION GEOGRAPHY
);

CREATE OR REPLACE TABLE RAW.STORES (
  STORE_ID STRING,
  STORE_NAME STRING,
  LOCATION GEOGRAPHY
);

## Load the data:
INSERT INTO RAW.DEVICE_PINGS
SELECT DEVICE_ID, PING_TS, ST_MAKEPOINT(LONGITUDE, LATITUDE)
FROM RAW.PINGS_STAGING;

## Validation in Snowflask
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM RAW.DEVICE_PINGS;
SELECT DEVICE_ID, ST_ASTEXT(LOCATION) FROM RAW.DEVICE_PINGS LIMIT 10;
SELECT HOUR(PING_TS) h, COUNT(*) FROM RAW.DEVICE_PINGS GROUP BY h ORDER BY h;
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM RAW.DEVICE_PINGS WHERE LOCATION IS NULL;

## Architecture
Mock GPS Pings (Python) → Snowflake (GEOGRAPHY) → Apache Sedona/PySpark → dbt → Kepler.gl/React

